step Rough Blasting Powder to 30
  tip Rough Blasting Powder is orange at 1 (yellow 20, green 30, grey 40): about 33 crafts to 30, up to 36 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 1 Rough Stone. One Rough Stone a craft; Rough Stone comes with the Copper Ore from Copper Veins.
  craft 3918 until 30

step Mining 41-50: Copper & Poor Copper
  tip Mine from Mining 41 to 50 for Handful of Copper Bolts: this area gives Copper Ore, and the next one the rest from Mining 50. The window lists the areas for your level, best first: the arrow leads to the one you pick and rests once you are in it; each keeps to creatures no more than a level above you and away from the other faction's towns.
