step Mining 125-155: Iron
  tip Mine from Mining 125 to 155 for Heavy Blasting Powder: this area gives Heavy Stone, and the next one the rest from Mining 155. The window lists the areas for your level, best first: the arrow leads to the one you pick and rests once you are in it; each keeps to creatures no more than a level above you and away from the other faction's towns.
