step Get Wool Cloth
  tip 25 Wool Cloth for Engineering 150-225: 25 Bronze Frameworks. Humanoids of level 15-30 drop it, and what you loot as you level counts. The arrow takes you to the best farm for your level: mobs at or below it first, then the most Wool Cloth per minute and the nearest; it picks again as you level. The guide window shows the kills and minutes it takes there and a second choice. Or buy them at the Auction House.
  collect 2592 x25 nearest gather levels 15-30
  auction 2592 x25

step Get Silver Bar
  tip 6 Silver Bar for Engineering 150-225: 27 Big Iron Bombs. Mining: smelt Silver Ore. Or buy them at the Auction House.
  collect 2842 x6 anywhere gather Mining 75
  auction 2842 x6

step Mine Coarse Stone, Copper Ore and Tin Ore, smelt Bronze Bar
  tip 9 Coarse Stone and 78 Bronze Bar for Engineering 150-166: 39 Aquadynamic Fish Attractors; from your mining on the way: 9 of 9 Coarse Stone, 39 of 39 Copper Ore and 39 of 39 Tin Ore. Your bags hold it already, smelt 78 Bronze Bar at a forge, then craft 31 Aquadynamic Fish Attractors (Engineering 150 to 166). The window lists the Mining areas for your level, best first: the arrow leads to the one you pick and rests there until your bags hold them.
  collect 2836 x9 gather Mining 65
