step Aquadynamic Fish Attractor to 166
  tip Aquadynamic Fish Attractor is yellow at 150 (yellow 150, green 160, grey 170): about 31 crafts to 166, up to 39 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 2 Bronze Bar, 1 Nightcrawlers and 1 Coarse Blasting Powder and makes 3. Make the 1 Coarse Blasting Powder first. Use the 30 Coarse Blasting Powder you made earlier; the counts above leave them out. Nightcrawlers come from trade and fishing suppliers; the attractors sell to fishermen. If you got here without learning Coarse Blasting Powder, learn it now: an earlier step teaches it.
  learn 3929
  craft 3929 x1
  craft 9271 until 166

step Mine Copper Ore and Tin Ore, smelt Bronze Bar
  tip 50 Bronze Bar for Engineering 166-175: 25 Bronze Frameworks; from your mining on the way: 9 of 25 Copper Ore and 25 of 25 Tin Ore. Mine 17 Copper Ore at the areas of Mining 50-65, the richest in it (they give no more points), smelt 50 Bronze Bar at a forge, then craft 19 Bronze Frameworks (Engineering 166 to 175). The window lists the Mining areas for your level, best first: the arrow leads to the one you pick and rests there until your bags hold them.
  collect 2841 x128 gather Mining 65
