step Bronze Framework to 175
  tip Bronze Framework is yellow at 166 (yellow 145, green 170, grey 195): about 19 crafts to 175, up to 25 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 2 Bronze Bar, 1 Medium Leather and 1 Wool Cloth. Bronze Frameworks are parts for later gadgets; the extras sell to vendors.
  craft 3953 until 175

step Mining 202-230: Iron & Mithril
  tip Mine from Mining 202 to 230 for Solid Blasting Powder: this area gives Solid Stone, and the next one the rest from Mining 230. The window lists the areas for your level, best first: the arrow leads to the one you pick and rests once you are in it; each keeps to creatures no more than a level above you and away from the other faction's towns.
