step Engineering recipes at 245
  tip Back to Buzzek Bracketswing (Tanaris) (Alliance) or Buzzek Bracketswing (Tanaris) (Horde): Mithril Gyro-Shot (from 245).
  learn 12621 npc 8736 only Alliance
  learn 12621 npc 8736 only Horde

step Mithril Gyro-Shot to 265
  tip Mithril Gyro-Shot is yellow at 245 (yellow 245, green 265, grey 285): about 28 crafts to 265, up to 33 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 2 Mithril Bar and 2 Solid Blasting Powder and makes 200. Make the 56 Solid Blasting Powder first. Two Mithril Bars and two Solid Blasting Powder a craft. Needs an anvil nearby. If you got here without learning Solid Blasting Powder, learn it now: an earlier step teaches it.
  learn 12585 npc 5174 only Alliance
  learn 12585 npc 11017 only Horde
  craft 12585 x56
  craft 12621 until 265

step Smelt Thorium
  tip A Mining trainer teaches Smelt Thorium (Mining 250, 2g): the bars of the next stretch are smelted from what you mine.
  learn 16153

step Mining 275-300: Small Thorium & Rich Thorium
  tip Mine from Mining 275 to 300 for Thorium Widget: this area gives Thorium Ore, and the next one the rest from Mining 300. The window lists the areas for your level, best first: the arrow leads to the one you pick and rests once you are in it; each keeps to creatures no more than a level above you and away from the other faction's towns.
